  <phrase title="cav7_ts_start_date_explain" version_id="1000070" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[The day the cadence counts from. It may be in the past: every 1 March since 2019 has its next ticket on the next 1 March, not today. Monthly and yearly keep this day of the month; a shorter month uses its last day.]]></phrase>
