  <phrase title="option_explain.cav7TicketScheduleOpenerUserId" version_id="1000070" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[The XenForo user every scheduled ticket is opened as. One user for the whole board. Default: 598, the bot user the suite already posts as. A save in the ticket schedule screens is refused while this names no user.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_group.cav7TicketSchedule" version_id="1000070" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[Ticket Schedule]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_group_description.cav7TicketSchedule" version_id="1000070" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[Opens an NF/Tickets ticket on a calendar cadence, so recurring work such as a yearly review has a ticket waiting on the day. Schedules are written under Tickets.]]></phrase>
